  "body": "## 更新内容 / What's New（安卓 v0.1.16）\n\n- 自律时段新增「完全锁定」：仅系统必要应用可用，个人可用名单失效；解锁码及提前结束入口不能解除，到点自动结束。不声称任何手机绝对不可绕过。\n- 安卓验收（隔离模拟器）：原生拦截判定下白名单 App 被拦、系统必要应用可放行；拦截页隐藏「提前结束 / 设为自律期间可用」并展示完全锁定说明；非完全锁定时段仍保留原提前结束入口。JVM / Dart 单测覆盖重叠优先、跨夜到点自然解除、跳过/暂停/删除/缩短在锁定进行中不可提前结束、旧配置缺省 completeLock=false。\n- 保留既有短间隔计时补记，以及解锁码每天最多成功 **3** 次（各入口共用、不可调）。\n- 已知 / 未复测：部分手机打开受限应用仍可能短暂露脸；小米相关问题尚未真机回测；未操作用户真机规则/解锁次数，未擅自装真机。\n- iPhone：本包未更新。当前可下载的 iPhone 版仍是 **v0.1.5**。完全锁定逻辑已写入 iOS 源码，但未做正式签名编译（开发者账号 / Family Controls / App Group 描述文件未就绪），因此没有发布新的 IPA；安卓不因 iOS 阻塞发布。\n\n- Schedules gain optional Complete Lock: only system-essential apps can open; personal allowlist is ignored; unlock code and early-end entries cannot lift it; ends when the schedule ends. No claim of absolute unbypassability on every phone.\n- Android acceptance (isolated emulator): native decide blocks allowlisted apps while essentials remain allowed; BlockActivity hides early-end / allow-in-focus and shows Complete Lock copy; non-lock schedules keep early-end. JVM/Dart unit tests cover overlap preference, overnight natural end, and skip/pause/delete/shorten blocked while lock is active; legacy JSON defaults completeLock=false.\n- Keeps short-interval usage catch-up and daily unlock success cap of **3**.\n- Known / not retested on the user's phone this turn: blocked apps may still flash briefly; Xiaomi still needs real-device retest.\n- iPhone: not updated. Downloadable iPhone build remains **v0.1.5**. Complete Lock logic exists in iOS source but is unsigned/uncompiled for release (developer account / Family Controls / App Group profiles not ready), so no new IPA; Android ships without waiting on iOS.\n\nversionCode: 37\nsha256: c0d55cdb79e32d3028d03b2cdc920a28827185e380aff759610786f963f42bb6\n",
